                "Alkylal-Voe AV-2 column D-7 is mid-cut at 118 C bottoms, 14 K under the 132 C freeze, "
                "reflux encoder 2.10 t/h versus a 6.40 t/h return cap. Keeping 4.8 t/h trimethylaluminum "
                "product is lawful; a reflux-led stop would shutter a quiet alkylaluminum stack.",